  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Can you fall in love with someone who is not your type? Especially the type you hate the most? Euntak, who has always dated small, pretty girls, falls in love at first sight with big, muscular Dojae. Apparently, Dojae figures it out from how Euntak is always making excuses to see him because he throws Euntak an unexpected offer: “Do you want to sleep with me? You like me.” It’s rude as hell, but Euntak can’t resist it. Will this careless affair evolve into a real relationship?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
